DATA SOURCES (parity manifest)
  The manifest record page:admin/BackupRestore declares NO API data sources ("renders from
  navigation values / local state"). Verified: the shared KMP core exposes NO backup-configs/runs
  repository (only SettingsBackupRepository = the settings JSON bundle, a separate unit). The page
  therefore binds an @Observable BackupRestorePageModel over an injectable BackupRestoreProviding
  seam (default LocalBackupRestoreProvider — a real, functional in-memory store: create/edit/delete
  configs, trigger + quick-backup runs, verify, preview). The view performs no I/O (P1/S8). When a
  shared backup repository lands (P1/S2-S3) the seam is swapped for an HTTP conformer with no view
  change.

